CORS(Cross-Origin Resource Sharing)
--------------------------------------
a browser-based security mechanism that uses HTTP headers to allow web applications at one
domain (origin) to access resources from a different domain.
-uses middleware provided by cors package.
-To install - npm i cors
-app.use(cors()) : to configure cors in server

=>JWT(Json Web Token)
----------------------
-Its an authentication mechanism used to provide user with more secure access.
-creates a random character string while authenticate, and user specific requests uses
 that string for further role based access requests.
-uses 'jsonwebtoken package with node.js
   npm i jsonwebtoken

-jsonwebtoken-> sign() : method used for creating a Token
     sign({payload,secretKey})
     payload: a piece of data that differentiate a user's Token
     secretKey:a constant value used in token generation and verification


